    "text": "Fuimos a comer dos personas. El sitio es enorme, por lo que si está un poco vacío, como en nuestro caso, parece un poco desangelado. El servicio por parte del personal podría haber sido algo mejor. La comida típica alemana, nada del otro mundo aunque merece la pena en caso de querer probar ese tipo de platos.",
    "textTranslated": "Two of us went for lunch. The place is huge, so if it's a bit empty, as it was when we were there, it feels a little soulless. The service could have been better. The food was typical German, nothing extraordinary, but it's worth a visit if you want to try that kind of cuisine."
  },
